    "https://ncwu.edu/community/careers/current-openings/graduate-assistant/": {
      "title": "Graduate Assistant Jobs",
      "description": "Graduate Assistant Jobs | North Carolina Wesleyan University Graduate Assistant Jobs | North Carolina Wesleyan University myNCWU Academic Calendar University Catalog Events Calendar Campus Map Student/Staff Email Directory Faculty & Staff Resources Recent News & Articles QUICKLINKS My NCWU Library Athletics The Dunn Center Alumni/Donors Student Achievement About Why NC Wesleyan? Campus Map & Tour Bishop Beliefs We are Battling Bishops Departments Publications Faculty & Staff Directory Contact Us Admissions Apply Visit Tuition Deposit Connect with a Counselor Orientation Financial Aid Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Executive Residency Programs Adult & Online Studies Accelerated Dual Degree Pathways Certificate Programs Partnerships Practical Skills Academy Registrar Library Our Faculty Accreditation & Accountability Adult & Online Adult Undergraduate Programs Adult Studies Tuition Financial Aid Graduate & Professional Programs Graduate Programs Tuition Campus Life Live. Eat. Play. Athletics Spiritual Life Student Engagement WesQuest Program International Student Resources Parent Resources First Year Experience Veteran Benefits Community The Dunn Center | Official Site Cultural Arts Mims and Gravely Art Galleries Work at Wesleyan Shelton Challenge Rock the Mount Community Event NCWU Summer Camps Event Venue Rentals About Why NC Wesleyan? Campus Map & Tour Bishop Beliefs We are Battling Bishops Departments Publications Faculty & Staff Directory Contact Us Admissions Apply Visit Tuition Deposit Connect with a Counselor Orientation Financial Aid Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Executive Residency Programs Adult & Online Studies Accelerated Dual Degree Pathways Certificate Programs Partnerships Practical Skills Academy Registrar Library Our Faculty Accreditation & Accountability Adult & Online Adult Undergraduate Programs Adult Studies Tuition Financial Aid Graduate & Professional Programs Graduate Programs Tuition Campus Life Live. Eat. Play. Athletics Spiritual Life Student Engagement WesQuest Program International Student Resources Parent Resources First Year Experience Veteran Benefits Community The Dunn Center | Official Site Cultural Arts Mims and Gravely Art Galleries Work at Wesleyan Shelton Challenge Rock the Mount Community Event NCWU Summer Camps Event Venue Rentals Graduate Assistant Jobs Community » Careers » Current Openings » Graduate Assistant Jobs Careers at Wesleyan Current Job Openings Administrative & Staff Jobs Graduate Assistant Jobs Faculty Job Openings Full-Time Faculty Positions Adjunct Faculty Positions Applications Download, complete and submit the fillable PDF applications below. Staff Employment Application The University currently has the following Graduate Assistant job openings: Graduate Intern 12-Month Position, unpaid; benefits detailed below DEPARTMENTS AVAILABLE: Admissions Advancement Athletics Marketing Masters of Public Health Resident Life Student Activities This is a graduate intern position that is open only to students who have completed their baccalaureate degree .  Interested applicants must apply to an NCWU graduate program and be pre-registered for full-time enrollment before they will be formally considered for this position.  Full-time enrollment consists of registration for at least six credits each academic semester and must begin by no later than the Summer term.  Continuous enrollment in good academic standing is required to maintain this position. Specific work schedules will be negotiated with the supervisor, but they will not include more than 15 hours of employment (on average) each week. BENEFITS INCLUDED: 25% tuition scholarship for graduate study Up to 20 hours of work per week Free housing in the designated graduate housing Opportunity to purchase a meal plan (optional) at the posted commuter rate The tuition scholarship can be spread out over 12 months or length of the graduate study Not all positions that are offered for Graduate Assistants (GA) may be fillable on a Graduate Intern (GI) basis. Some positions may be offered that are only open to Graduate Interns PRINCIPAL RESPONSIBILITIES – will be determined by the department. QUALIFICATIONS Acceptance to a graduate degree program and active enrollment in graduate classes with NCWU. Enrollment must be continuous during your tenure in this position, and you must maintain good academic standing in your academic program. If you fail to maintain enrollment, employment in this position would be terminated. Ability to work independently and in team environments. Ability to work on multiple concurrent projects and activities. Must have the ability to interact with the university community. Strong work ethic Experience with Microsoft and Jenzabar software preferred PLEASE NOTE : This position does not include health insurance or retirement benefits. Resumes should be forwarded to: Suzanne Brackett Sr. VP of Administration sbrackett@ncwu.edu For questions or inquiries regarding careers at North Carolina Wesleyan, please contact: Darrell Whitley Director of Human Resources 252.985.5105 dwhitley@ncwu.edu Employment Policies Title IX Policies & Procedures Equal Employment Opportunity (See Personnel Manual) NC Wesleyan University 3400 N. Wesleyan Blvd. Rocky Mount, NC 27804 252.985.5100 800.488.6292 Contact Us Campus Map All Social Media Channels > Resources My NCWU University Catalog Request More Info Events News Student Email Policies & Notices Title IX and Equal Opportunity Campus Hazing Policy Faculty & Staff Resources Media & Branding Resources Alumni Relations Bishop Beat Newsletter Student Achievement Report Academic Program Inventory Consumer Information Transcript Requests Working at Wesleyan Campus Campus Map & Tour Campus Store Campus Safety Parent Resources The Dunn Center Faculty & Staff Directory Health Services Library Wesleyan News Dining Services Catering Services Event Venue Rentals Dunn Center Rental Space Photo Gallery Apply Request More Info Plan A Visit Give 252.985.5100    |      800.488.6292 ©2026 North Carolina Wesleyan University NCWU About Why NC Wesleyan? Campus Map & Tour Bishop Beliefs We are Battling Bishops Departments Publications Faculty & Staff Directory Contact Us Admissions Apply Visit Tuition Deposit Connect with a Counselor Orientation Financial Aid Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Executive Residency Programs Adult & Online Studies Accelerated Dual Degree Pathways Certificate Programs Partnerships Practical Skills Academy Registrar Library Our Faculty Accreditation & Accountability Adult & Online Adult Undergraduate Programs Adult Studies Tuition Financial Aid Graduate & Professional Programs Graduate Programs Tuition Campus Life Live. Eat. Play. Athletics Spiritual Life Student Engagement WesQuest Program International Student Resources Parent Resources First Year Experience Veteran Benefits Community The Dunn Center | Official Site Cultural Arts Mims and Gravely Art Galleries Work at Wesleyan Shelton Challenge Rock the Mount Community Event NCWU Summer Camps Event Venue Rentals Athletics The Dunn Center Alumni/Donors Ways to Give Library Apply for Admissions My NCWU Campus Resources Campus Map News Student Email Event Calendar Academic Calendar University Catalog Faculty & Staff Event Venue Rentals"
